      "title": {
        "en": "Task Notifier",
        "zh": "任务通知台"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A chime and a system notification the moment a task finishes. The sidebar panel splits needs-input, running and unread-done sessions, and unread state survives a restart.",
        "zh": "任务跑完响一声，系统通知同时弹出。侧边栏面板把待回复、运行中、已完成未读分开，未读状态重启后还在。"
      },
